@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor kwin
# As wl-im-forward.keys, with KWin's input-method-v1:
# Keys HIME does not handle reach the application through the virtual
# keyboard, in order after the text committed before them.
a <space> a <space> <bs> @check
C-<space> x y <bs> z @check
# Shift alone switches to English and back, the application also gets it
C-<space> <shift> a b <shift> a <space>
